        "id": 1140964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-12-02T16:03:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We could but this is code that is unique (no SSE implementation), not speed critical (to avoid a 64-bit multiplication) and there is nothing we would gain by making sure m2 fits in a uint32_t. Might as well keep it that way 😊",
      "parentUuid": "0f7b4383_7d83cbc1",
      "revId": "f776da44f483afb7e5937a2a91dc98048082c64d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
